        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Anxiety and worry"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports excessive worry most days, worse in the evenings and overnight, and feeling more on edge over the last few weeks. Worries about memory, chest symptoms, cancer, and heart problems."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Takes longer to fall asleep and wakes 1–2 times nightly with worry; settles after staff reassurance. No nightmares."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Chest tightness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent mild chest tightness when anxious, lasting minutes and settling with slow breathing and staff presence; similar pattern for years and unchanged. No clear exertional component or radiation; no diaphoresis, nausea, vomiting, or collapse."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
